     "transcript": [
      {
       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 11.533,
       "text": "一条链，每个节点延迟 1，跨簇加 D = 3。分成两簇：跨界一次，延迟 7。",
       "sceneId": "k01-goal"
      },
      {
       "start": 11.533,
       "end": 15.889,
       "text": "换一种分法，跨界两次：延迟 10。",
       "sceneId": "k01-goal"
      },
      {
       "start": 15.889,
       "end": 21.133,
       "text": "目标变了：最长路径的延迟，而不是 cut。",
       "sceneId": "k01-goal"
      },
      {
       "start": 21.533,
       "end": 26.733,
       "text": "RW 的模型：组合电路是一张有向无环图。",
       "sceneId": "k02-model"
      },
      {
       "start": 26.733,
       "end": 29.533,
       "text": "每个节点有延迟 δ。",
       "sceneId": "k02-model"
      },
      {
       "start": 29.533,
       "end": 35.2,
       "text": "簇内连线不加延迟，跨簇连线固定加 D。",
       "sceneId": "k02-model"
      },
      {
       "start": 35.2,
       "end": 38.0,
       "text": "每个簇有容量 M。",
       "sceneId": "k02-model"
      },
      {
       "start": 38.0,
       "end": 43.2,
       "text": "而且允许复制节点：这是最优性的前提。",
       "sceneId": "k02-model"
      },
      {
       "start": 43.6,
       "end": 51.733,
       "text": "候选 DAG 由原作影片复原：12 个节点，PI a、b、c，PO k、l。",
       "sceneId": "k03-delta"
      },
      {
       "start": 51.733,
       "end": 58.756,
       "text": "Δ(b, k) = 4：沿 b、e、g、i、k，计终点不计起点。",
       "sceneId": "k03-delta"
      },
      {
       "start": 58.756,
       "end": 62.889,
       "text": "PI 的标签就是自己的延迟：1。",
       "sceneId": "k03-delta"
      },
      {
       "start": 63.289,
       "end": 66.978,
       "text": "按拓扑序打标签。看节点 i。",
       "sceneId": "k04-label"
      },
      {
       "start": 66.978,
       "end": 72.222,
       "text": "每个祖先的得分：l(x) + Δ(x, i)。",
       "sceneId": "k04-label"
      },
      {
       "start": 72.222,
       "end": 80.356,
       "text": "容量 4：取得分最高的 g、e、c；平票时拓扑序靠后的优先，这是假设。",
       "sceneId": "k04-label"
      },
      {
       "start": 80.356,
       "end": 87.156,
       "text": "簇内 PI c 给 l1 = 4；簇外最大的 b 给 l2 = 4 + 3 = 7。",
       "sceneId": "k04-label"
      },
      {
       "start": 87.156,
       "end": 90.844,
       "text": "l(i) = 7。标签是时间。",
       "sceneId": "k04-label"
      },
      {
       "start": 91.244,
       "end": 96.444,
       "text": "从输出倒推：先取 k 和 l 的候选簇。",
       "sceneId": "k05-reconstruct"
      },
      {
       "start": 96.444,
